libniji C library: development files
 libniji is an implementation of the GNU C Library's ABI (glibc $abi, x86-64).
 This package holds libniji's C headers in /usr/include (the machine-specific
 ones in /usr/include/x86_64-linux-gnu), the start files, the libc.so linker
 script, libc_nonshared.a and the static archives.
